  "body": "Step into this beautifully maintained three-bedroom 1940s brick character bungalow, perfectly blending classic charm with modern comfort. Set on a quiet street in sought-after Narrow Neck, this private, sunny haven offers space, versatility, and lifestyle for your family. The open plan modern kitchen, dining and lounge flows seamlessly to a sheltered deck – perfect for entertaining year-round. \r\nA separate garden studio – ideal as a second living area, creative space, or home office is set amongst an established landscaped garden creating a peaceful retreat. \r\nA heat pump provides year-round comfort and there is attic storage and off-street parking for 2–3 vehicles\r\nEnjoy the convenience of being close to Narrow Neck Beach, local cafés, and the nearby golf course. Zoned for top schools and well-serviced by public transport, including the ferry to Auckland’s CBD, commuting is effortless while lifestyle remains paramount.\r\nWith the vendor relocating out of Auckland, this is your opportunity to secure a character-filled home in a tightly held coastal community.\r\nPrivate, peaceful and perfectly positioned – this is bungalow living at its best. Phone for a private viewing, no open homes.",
